{"id":"30a1cf9b20b2ebb1","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-point-process.md","title":"Point Process","display":"df-point-process — Point Process","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-point-process","aliases":["58-df-point-process","Point Process"],"display":"df-point-process — Point Process","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob4-probability-measure.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[58-df-measure]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-point-process"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-point-process</span><span>Point Process</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-point-process — Point Process"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b7f8df0ffe546f56\" href=\"?note=b7f8df0ffe546f56\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob4-probability-measure.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob4-probability-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"58-df-measure\">58-df-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\">\\((\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\)</span> (probability space, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b7f8df0ffe546f56\" href=\"?note=b7f8df0ffe546f56\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob4-probability-measure.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob4-probability-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(S,\\mathcal B)\">\\((S,\\mathcal B)\\)</span> (measurable state space, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> (random counting measure, coded as a function on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> (intensity measure on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(S,\\mathcal B)\">\\((S,\\mathcal B)\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"58-df-measure\">58-df-measure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb4ProbabilityMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb4ProbabilityMeasure}_S\\)</span> (probability-measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b7f8df0ffe546f56\" href=\"?note=b7f8df0ffe546f56\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob4-probability-measure.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob4-probability-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span> (measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"58-df-measure\">58-df-measure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CountingMeasure}_S,\\operatorname{PointProcess}_S,\\operatorname{PoissonPointProcess}_S,\\operatorname{IndependentCounts}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CountingMeasure}_S,\\operatorname{PointProcess}_S,\\operatorname{PoissonPointProcess}_S,\\operatorname{IndependentCounts}_S\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}point\\text{-}process} \\vdash \\mathrm{CountingMeasure}_S(m,S,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(m,S,\\mathcal B)\\land \\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(m(B)\\in\\omega\\cup\\{\\infty\\})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}point\\text{-}process} \\vdash \\mathrm{CountingMeasure}_S(m,S,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(m,S,\\mathcal B)\\land \\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(m(B)\\in\\omega\\cup\\{\\infty\\})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}point\\text{-}process} \\vdash \\operatorname{PointProcess}_S(N,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,S,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProb4ProbabilityMeasure}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land \\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal B,S)\\land N:\\Omega\\to\\{m:\\mathrm{CountingMeasure}_S(m,S,\\mathcal B)\\}\\land \\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\,\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;(\\{\\alpha\\in\\Omega:N(\\alpha)(B)=k\\}\\in\\mathcal F)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}point\\text{-}process} \\vdash \\operatorname{PointProcess}_S(N,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,S,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProb4ProbabilityMeasure}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land \\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal B,S)\\land N:\\Omega\\to\\{m:\\mathrm{CountingMeasure}_S(m,S,\\mathcal B)\\}\\land \\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\,\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;(\\{\\alpha\\in\\Omega:N(\\alpha)(B)=k\\}\\in\\mathcal F)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}point\\text{-}process} \\vdash \\operatorname{IndependentCounts}_S(N,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal B,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\forall n\\in\\omega\\,\\forall C:n\\to\\mathcal B\\,\\Bigl(\\bigl(\\forall i,j\\in n\\;(i\\ne j\\to C_i\\cap C_j=\\emptyset)\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(\\mu(C_i)&lt;\\infty)\\bigr)\\to\\forall k:n\\to\\omega\\;\\mathbb P(\\bigcap_{i\\in n}\\{\\alpha\\in\\Omega:N(\\alpha)(C_i)=k_i\\})=\\prod_{i\\in n}\\mathbb P(\\{\\alpha\\in\\Omega:N(\\alpha)(C_i)=k_i\\})\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}point\\text{-}process} \\vdash \\operatorname{IndependentCounts}_S(N,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal B,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow \\forall n\\in\\omega\\,\\forall C:n\\to\\mathcal B\\,\\Bigl(\\bigl(\\forall i,j\\in n\\;(i\\ne j\\to C_i\\cap C_j=\\emptyset)\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;(\\mu(C_i)&lt;\\infty)\\bigr)\\to\\forall k:n\\to\\omega\\;\\mathbb P(\\bigcap_{i\\in n}\\{\\alpha\\in\\Omega:N(\\alpha)(C_i)=k_i\\})=\\prod_{i\\in n}\\mathbb P(\\{\\alpha\\in\\Omega:N(\\alpha)(C_i)=k_i\\})\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}point\\text{-}process} \\vdash \\operatorname{PoissonPointProcess}_S(N,\\mu,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,S,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{PointProcess}_S(N,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,S,\\mathcal B)\\land \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,S,\\mathcal B)\\land \\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\,\\bigl(\\mu(B)&lt;\\infty\\to\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathbb P(\\{\\alpha\\in\\Omega:N(\\alpha)(B)=k\\})=e^{-\\mu(B)}\\frac{\\mu(B)^k}{k!})\\bigr)\\land \\operatorname{IndependentCounts}_S(N,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal B,\\mu)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}point\\text{-}process} \\vdash \\operatorname{PoissonPointProcess}_S(N,\\mu,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,S,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{PointProcess}_S(N,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,S,\\mathcal B)\\land \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,S,\\mathcal B)\\land \\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\,\\bigl(\\mu(B)&lt;\\infty\\to\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathbb P(\\{\\alpha\\in\\Omega:N(\\alpha)(B)=k\\})=e^{-\\mu(B)}\\frac{\\mu(B)^k}{k!})\\bigr)\\land \\operatorname{IndependentCounts}_S(N,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal B,\\mu)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Point process: random collection of points in space; counts points in Borel sets</li>\n<li>Poisson: most fundamental; completely characterized by intensity measure</li>\n<li>Intensity may be recovered by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(B)=\\mathbb E[N(\\cdot)(B)]\">\\(\\mu(B)=\\mathbb E[N(\\cdot)(B)]\\)</span> on finite-intensity measurable sets.</li>\n<li>The Laplace functional identity is a theorem downstream from the Poisson point process definition.</li>\n<li>Campbell: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{E}[\\sum f(X_i)] = \\int f(x) \\mu(dx)\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[\\sum f(X_i)] = \\int f(x) \\mu(dx)\\)</span>; spatial moment measure</li>\n<li>Gibbs: pairwise interaction; intensity involves interaction potential <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi\">\\(\\phi\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Daley and Vere-Jones, An Introduction to the Theory of Point Processes</li>\n<li>Kingman, Poisson Processes</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-prob4-probability-measure.md","s